Landay, Terah Lyons, James Manyika, Juan Carlos Niebles, Yoav Shoham, Elham Tabassi, Russell Wald, Toby Walsh, and Dan Weld (2026), The AI Index 2026 Annual Report (PDF) (Stanford, Calif.: AI Index Steering Committee, 
