     6	                                       September 16, 2026
     7	
     8	
     9	       CHAIRMAN WARSH. Good day. In the meeting just concluded, the FOMC decided to
    10	
    11	raise the target range for the federal funds rate by ¼ percentage point to 3¾ to 4 percent, in
    12	
    13	support of the Federal Reserve’s dual mandate. The Committee is continuing its policy of
    14	
    15	maintaining ample reserves in the banking system.
    16	
    17	       As noted in the Policy Statement, released just a short while ago, economic activity is
    18	
    19	expanding at a solid pace. While uncertainty remains elevated—owing, in part, to geopolitical
    20	
    21	developments—domestic spending has been resilient. Productivity growth is strong, and capital
    22	
    23	investment is robust. Job gains have kept pace with the workforce, and the unemployment rate
    24	
    25	has changed little.
    26	
    27	       But inflation remains elevated. Today’s policy action will support a timelier return to the
    28	
    29	Committee’s 2 percent goal. This Committee will deliver price stability.
    30	
    31	       Now I’ll get into some further detail:
    32	
    33	       Our decision comes at a time when the American economy appears to be strengthening.
    34	
    35	New hiring, private-sector earnings, business capital investment—each of these markers has
    36	
    37	improved in recent months and is pointing in a good direction. Credit flows have been robust,
    38	
    39	particularly for businesses. And as I said at the policy symposium in Jackson Hole, I would be
    40	
    41	hard-pressed to describe broad financial conditions as restrictive. This view was widely shared
    42	
    43	by the Committee. So we removed a dose of accommodation.
    44	
    45	       Consider the geopolitical landscape of shocks and uncertainty, and you begin to
    46	
    47	appreciate the resilience of the U.S. economy. Given that resilience, and the potential for even
    48	
    49	
    50	
    51	
    52	                                           Page 1 of 15
